{"id":1060102,"chapter_id":1060102,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"殷红的幕布拉开，台下坐满了黑压压的观众。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"你确信自己曾见过这样的景象。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"options":["这里是哈梅尔的梦"],"style":6,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102003,"trial_step":3,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"这里是哈梅尔的梦","goto":4}]},{"step":4,"content":"你在审查前经历过相同的梦境。正如你所预料的，身后响起了报幕员的声音。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"报幕员","content":"接下来请欣赏独舞——","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":11,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"“啪——”，一束灼热的聚光灯亮起，炙烤着你的头顶。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"观众会变成水母状的幽影扑来——你做好了心理准备，精神的链接不会无故产生，她一定记起了什么重要的过去，或许这其中就有导致她迷惘的谜底。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"…… ……","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"……","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"观众","content":"这就是传说中的绝世舞姬？","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"没有幽影扑来。此次的梦境有些微妙的不同，观众们只是在底下窃窃私语。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"观众","content":"说好看演出庆祝我们的纪念日的，她怎么一直耷拉着脸。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"观众","content":"跳啊！傻站着干什么！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"观众","content":"出名了，不乐意给我们这些普通观众跳舞了？","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"观众","content":"音乐呢？赶紧开始，爷要看点热闹的！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"观众","content":"哭丧着给谁看啊，真晦气！不跳就滚！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"台下嘁嘁喳喳的，精神的链接轻轻跳动，将梦境主人的不适同步至你的感官。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"？？","content":"怎么了，我的孩子？他们都是为你而来的，快跳啊，去为他们跳舞。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"穿着讲究的女人从幕后探出身子。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"母亲……他们想要的，是喜庆欢愉的靡靡之音。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"母亲","content":"那又如何？你按他们想要的跳就行了。你是天才，我知道的，无论什么样的舞，你都可以跳出来！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"可是，世间流动着悲伤的韵律，我要如何为欢愉起舞？","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"你随着梦境主人的视线看去，蓝紫色的烟雾在眼前聚散，凝聚为一个熟悉的环形后突然炸开，散落为星星点点愁绪飘散空中。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"这就是哈梅尔从小能看见的假性幻觉吗？","style":2,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"母亲","content":"嘘——不许再提这件事了！无论内海大爆炸让你看见了什么脏东西，答应妈妈，别说出去。你是舞蹈家，不能是怪人疯子……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"可是……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"哈梅尔还想再说些什么，母亲却已经焦急地从幕后伸出手，一把将她推上了台。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"紧接着，热闹的鼓点响起，梦境的主人，被迫登场。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"“一、二、三、四……”","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"哈梅尔在心中默数着节拍，你的视角也随着哈梅尔的动作悦动旋转。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"你看见她衣袖所过之处，都升起了蓝紫色的云雾，舞台在哈梅尔的眼中变得迷离梦幻。一个熟悉的身影在云雾中现形。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"幽影","content":"你为舞蹈而生，舞姿是你的连接世界的方式。你用肢体感受一切，但——你都感受到了什么？","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"梦境的主人穿梭在云雾之间，用手指体会着空气的流动。指尖感触到的悲伤和乐曲的欣快在她的血脉间相互拉扯，依赖肌肉的记忆，舞步才未因此凌乱。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"幽影","content":"破碎的，悲伤的……这才是你想要讲述的，也是大爆炸留给这个城市的……但却并非他们想要看到的。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"观众","content":"好！绝世舞姬的感染力名不虚传！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"绮丽的云彩黯淡了一些，舞步渐渐虚浮。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"幽影","content":"记得他们的样子吗？他们不懂，也不想懂……自我麻痹的媒介，逃避现实的工具——你对他们而言，仅仅如此。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"观众","content":"继续！再跳一曲！再跳一曲！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"content":"幻觉的云彩散去大半，欢呼与喝彩几乎盖过了舞曲的乐声。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"幽影","content":"这是你的艺术吗，这是你想要的舞蹈吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"母亲","content":"我的好女儿，好好跳吧，为我跳出后半生的荣华富贵——","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"云雾褪去了，现实变得无比清晰。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"content":"视角不再旋转悦动，你感受不到她血液中最感性的欲望，一切对破碎之美的表达冲动，都在这场与虚假欢欣的搏斗中，落了下风。哈梅尔停下了舞步。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"她的视线扫过台下一张张嗤笑的、自以为幸福的脸，脚步晃了晃。","style":3,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"咚——！","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"她倒在了聚光灯下。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"幽影","content":"你找到答案了吗？为何选择黑环，为何留在那里？","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102049,"trial_step":49},{"step":49,"content":"黑暗之中，幽影拂过哈梅尔的脸庞。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102050,"trial_step":50},{"step":50,"speaker":"幽影","content":"外面的世界容不下你，回去吧，那里才有你真正想要的。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102051,"trial_step":51},{"step":51,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"回去，回去……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102052,"trial_step":52},{"step":52,"content":"景色变幻，冰面折射出的眩光将你引入下一段梦境。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102054,"trial_step":54},{"step":53,"content":"嘉年华的湖心舞台？","style":2,"background":708,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102055,"trial_step":55},{"step":54,"content":"这是你和哈梅尔都无比熟悉的地方，黑色的水母悬停于湖心，似乎一直在等待哈梅尔的到来。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102056,"trial_step":56},{"step":55,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"回到这里，就能找到那个答案吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102057,"trial_step":57},{"step":56,"speaker":"幽影","content":"当然，你不相信我吗？","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102058,"trial_step":58},{"step":57,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"可是，你只是最近才出现在梦境里的虚像……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102059,"trial_step":59},{"step":58,"speaker":"幽影","content":"不——","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102060,"trial_step":60},{"step":59,"content":"幽影向哈梅尔逼近。","style":3,"background":708,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102061,"trial_step":61},{"step":60,"speaker":"幽影","content":"我一直在你身边。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":708,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102062,"trial_step":62},{"step":61,"speaker":"空虚傀儡","content":"舞姬不需要被问候，只要跳舞就够了。我们做你的观众。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":704,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102064,"trial_step":64},{"step":62,"content":"<b>市民</b>\n跳啊！傻站着干什么！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":14,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102065,"trial_step":65},{"step":63,"speaker":"苦痛傀儡","content":"只要看到你的舞蹈，内心就能重回平静。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":701,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102066,"trial_step":66},{"step":64,"content":"<b>观众</b>\n音乐呢？赶紧开始，爷要看点热闹的！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":14,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102067,"trial_step":67},{"step":65,"speaker":"恐惧傀儡","content":"我们无法言说的悲伤，无法表达的痛苦，你都能理解，都感同身受，并用舞蹈代替我们哀诉。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":801,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102068,"trial_step":68},{"step":66,"speaker":"母亲","content":"<b>母亲</b>\n怪人，疯子……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":14,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102069,"trial_step":69},{"step":67,"content":"<b>死役</b>\n跳吧，跳吧……哈梅尔，用你的舞蹈——为我们实现吧！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":14,"background":705,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102070,"trial_step":70},{"step":68,"speaker":"弟弟","content":"<b>弟弟</b>\n别再跳了，姐姐！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":14,"background":1032,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102071,"trial_step":71},{"step":69,"content":"<b>死役</b>\n谢谢你，我们爱你……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":14,"background":705,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102072,"trial_step":72},{"step":70,"content":"扑通——","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102075,"trial_step":75},{"step":71,"content":"你听见跃入湖底的声音，刺骨的冰水涌入口鼻，绝望的窒息感将你拉回现实。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102076,"trial_step":76},{"step":72,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"是啊，你一直在我身边……我真正想要的……我不舍离开的理由……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102073,"trial_step":73},{"step":73,"speaker":"哈梅尔","content":"一直在这里……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102074,"trial_step":74},{"step":74,"content":"！！！","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102077,"trial_step":77},{"step":75,"content":"我知道哈梅尔想要的是什么了……","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102078,"trial_step":78},{"step":76,"content":"舞蹈是观众与舞者最直接的审美交流，而哈梅尔的破碎之舞不可能被浮华的狄斯大舞台接受，能接受她的只有——","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102079,"trial_step":79},{"step":77,"content":"同样经历过破碎的死役。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102080,"trial_step":80},{"step":78,"content":"这个梦非常漫长，现在已经是凌晨，管理局内大部分人都已经睡下，但你无法按捺住分享结论的心情。得尽快把整个答案告诉哈梅尔才行。","style":3,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102081,"trial_step":81},{"step":79,"content":"但愿……她还记得自己梦里的内容。","style":2,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102082,"trial_step":82},{"step":80,"content":"但当你匆匆赶到禁闭者的收容区，看到的却是哈梅尔空空如也的房间。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102084,"trial_step":84},{"step":81,"speaker":"警报","content":"警告！警告！禁闭者S-008失踪！请所有警卫排查管理局各个角落！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":11,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102085,"trial_step":85},{"step":82,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长！你推测得没错，哈梅尔确实往嘉年华方向去了。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102086,"trial_step":86},{"step":83,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"另外我们还检测到，那些游荡在锈河一带的零散死役，似乎也受到某种感召，正在向嘉年华方向聚集！","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102087,"trial_step":87},{"step":84,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"我已经联系了沿途所有可调派的人员，会尽可能拖住她的行动，同时降低游荡死役对锈河拾荒平民的影响。","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102088,"trial_step":88},{"step":85,"content":"死役……观众……","style":2,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102089,"trial_step":89},{"step":86,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"您的脸色不太好，是半夜惊醒的缘故吗？还是因为枷锁……","voice":["vo_trial_60102_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_hameier_trial","style":1,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102090,"trial_step":90},{"step":87,"content":"不，枷锁没有异常，是我个人有些犹豫……","style":2,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102091,"trial_step":91},{"step":88,"content":"观众把她当取乐的玩物，亲人把她当作异类和赚钱工具，普通民众把她当作新闻和谈资。连管理局……也只是把她当作高危禁闭者。","style":3,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102092,"trial_step":92},{"step":89,"content":"就像当初决心留在黑环内一样，现在的她想要逃离现实回到她最后的舞台。","style":3,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102093,"trial_step":93},{"step":90,"content":"真的要阻拦她吗？","style":2,"background":1024,"log_type":1,"src_id":160102094,"trial_step":94}]}